4 IDX G9 CHEM S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Dimensions are the fundamental types of physical quantities,"Dimensions,fundamental,types,physical,quantities"
4 IDX G9 CHEM S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,The main idea of dimensional analysis is to check the consistency of equations and to help in deriving relationships between physical quantities. It's like a grammar check for the language of physics and engineering equations.,"main,idea,dimensional,analysis,check,consistency,equations,help,deriving,relationships,physical,quantities,like,grammar,check,language,physics,engineering,equations"
