S Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,15.3 Heterogeneous Aqueous Systems 1. Suspensions DeﬁniCon: A suspension is a mixture from which parCcles seMle out upon standing. Key CharacterisBcs:  ParBcle Size: >1000 nm Type of Mixture: Heterogeneous (two substances can be clearly idenBﬁed). FiltraBon: ParBcles can be separated by ﬁltraBon. Example: A mixture of sand and water is a suspension because sand parBcles are large enough to be separated by ﬁltraBon.,"Heterogeneous,Aqueous,Systems,Suspensions,De,niCon,suspension,mixture,parCcles,seMle,upon,standing,Key,CharacterisBcs,ParBcle,Size,nm,Type,Mixture,Heterogeneous,two,substances,clearly,idenB,ed,FiltraBon,ParBcles,separated,ltraBon,Example,mixture,sand,water,suspension,sand,parBcles,large,enough,separated,ltraBon"
S Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"2. Colloids DeﬁniCon: A heterogeneous mixture containing parCcles ranging from 1 nm to 1000 nm. Dispersion Medium: Solid, liquid, or gas. Key CharacterisBcs:  Intermediate-sized parBcles that cannot be ﬁltered. ParBcles do not se`le over Bme. Tyndall Eﬀect: The sca`ering of visible light by colloidal parBcles. Example: A beam of light passing through fog or mist. Brownian MoCon: The chaoBc movement of colloidal parBcles caused by collisions with molecules in the dispersion medium. CoagulaCon: Colloidal parBcles adsorb ions from the medium, gaining charge, which prevents aggregaBon. Suspension vs. SoluBonSuspensionSoluBonParBcle Size>1000 nm≈1 nmMixture TypeHeterogeneousHomogeneousSeparaBon by FiltraBonCan be separatedCannot be separated","Colloids,De,niCon,heterogeneous,mixture,containing,parCcles,ranging,nm,nm,Dispersion,Medium,Solid,liquid,gas,Key,CharacterisBcs,Intermediate,sized,parBcles,cannot,ltered,ParBcles,se,le,Bme,Tyndall,E,ect,sca,ering,visible,light,colloidal,parBcles,Example,beam,light,passing,fog,mist,Brownian,MoCon,chaoBc,movement,colloidal,parBcles,caused,collisions,molecules,dispersion,medium,CoagulaCon,Colloidal,parBcles,adsorb,ions,medium,gaining,charge,prevents,aggregaBon,Suspension,vs,SoluBonSuspensionSoluBonParBcle,Size,nm,nmMixture,TypeHeterogeneousHomogeneousSeparaBon,FiltraBonCan,separatedCannot,separated"
