AP Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"•If TR = TC, the ﬁrm breaks even. •If TR < TC, the ﬁrm incurs a loss. 1.Break-even price: market price at which it earns zero proﬁts. 2.market price > minimum ATC  ➔ proﬁtable. 3.market price = minimum ATC  ➔ breaks even. 4.market price < minimum ATC ➔ unproﬁtable. Market Structure: 1.Perfect compe99on: •Firms are price-takers •Free entry and exit •No barriers 2.Monopoly: •no close subsEtutes •industry controlled by a monopolist •barriers to entry: a.Control of a Scarce Resource or Input b.Economies of scale c.Technological superiority d.Government created barriers","TR,TC,rm,breaks,even,TR,TC,rm,incurs,loss,Break,even,price,market,price,earns,zero,pro,ts,market,price,minimum,ATC,pro,table,market,price,minimum,ATC,breaks,even,market,price,minimum,ATC,unpro,table,Market,Structure,Perfect,compe,Firms,price,takers,Free,entry,exit,barriers,Monopoly,close,subsEtutes,industry,controlled,monopolist,barriers,entry,Control,Scarce,Resource,Input,b,Economies,scale,c,Technological,superiority,Government,created,barriers"
