H Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"the guys lusted over.  Revelry - noisy festivities; playful - And then, in the middle of the  revelry, we heard a knock at the door. Legitimate - real or true - A guard  examined the driver’s papers, which were  legitimate. The guard did not know we  were in the back of the van.  Exonerated -to clear of blame - My dad glanced at my mom and for  one delirious second I thought I was o the hook, that somehow I’d  exonerated myself, and that we could all just go back to business as  usual.  Virtuous -full of integrity; showing high  moral standards - He believed a man  should work hard with his hands, that  toil and sweat were evidence of a  virtuous life.  Advocating - publicly recommend or support - Now I work with a  group in Wilmington that’s advocating for legislation reform for  immigrants. Misguided - showing bad judgement or  reasoning - What did it matter, my instinct  to protect him, my misguided idea that  somehow by keeping all of this from him, I  could prove that I was capable, I could  prove that I could take care of our daughter  even though I had failed her so terribly  before?  Condolence - an expression or sympathy, especially during a time of","guys,lusted,Revelry,noisy,festivities,playful,middle,revelry,heard,knock,door,Legitimate,real,true,guard,examined,driver,papers,legitimate,guard,know,back,van,Exonerated,clear,blame,dad,glanced,mom,one,delirious,second,thought,hook,somehow,exonerated,could,go,back,business,usual,Virtuous,full,integrity,showing,high,moral,standards,believed,man,work,hard,hands,toil,sweat,evidence,virtuous,life,Advocating,publicly,recommend,support,work,group,Wilmington,advocating,legislation,reform,immigrants,Misguided,showing,bad,judgement,reasoning,matter,instinct,protect,misguided,idea,somehow,keeping,could,prove,capable,could,prove,could,take,care,daughter,even,though,failed,terribly,Condolence,expression,sympathy,especially,time"
H Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"death - She apologized over and over, and though at first I mistook  her apologies for condolences, I realized soon enough that she  believed she had a role in what had happened—or maybe that Mayor  did  Impetuous - done quickly without  thought - Not exactly the girl she used  to be before the accident, which was  the girl I thought I had been searching  for, but my Maribel, brave and  impetuous and kind.  Assaulted - Physically attacked - We don’t deal with teenage  relationships here. Unless he assaulted her in some way, or unless  he made some kind of verbal threat, there’s nothing we can do. Erupt- To burst forth suddenly and  violently - My hip throbbed. Coach blew his  whistle and jogged in to untangle us. The  girls erupted in laughter.  Discarded -to get rid of or throw away death - Later, when he stopped  again and pointed to a discarded kitchen table, and later again at a  mattress propped up like a sliding board against someone’s mailbox,  we understood what to do and loaded them into the truck.  Barren - empty or lacking in vegetation,  often land that is unable to support plant  life. - It was snowing when we  arrived—Enrique kept complaining  that the snow was going to mess up  his beloved Adidas sneakers—and  everything was so colorless and","death,apologized,though,first,mistook,apologies,condolences,realized,soon,enough,believed,role,happened,maybe,Mayor,Impetuous,done,quickly,without,thought,exactly,girl,used,accident,girl,thought,searching,Maribel,brave,impetuous,kind,Assaulted,Physically,attacked,deal,teenage,relationships,Unless,assaulted,way,unless,made,kind,verbal,threat,nothing,Erupt,burst,forth,suddenly,violently,hip,throbbed,Coach,blew,whistle,jogged,untangle,us,girls,erupted,laughter,Discarded,get,rid,throw,away,death,Later,stopped,pointed,discarded,kitchen,table,later,mattress,propped,like,sliding,board,someone,mailbox,understood,loaded,truck,Barren,empty,lacking,vegetation,often,land,unable,suppor