AP Precalculus Review Guide.pdf,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"- Linear Programming: A mathematical model consisting of a linear function to be optimized (maximized or minimized) and a set of inequalities representing the restrictions on resources;  - Objective Function: The function to be maximized or minimized in a linear program; This function might represent amounts of money earned or spent, goods manufactured or delivered, or any of a variety of other quantities.  - Constraints: The linear inequalities;   - Feasible Region: The solution of the system of linear inequalities; If a linear program has a solution, it will occur at a vertex (corner point) of the feasible region. If there are multiple solutions, at least one of them will occur at a vertex. - To solve a linear program:  - Solve the system of linear inequalities. Determine the coordinates of the vertices of the feasible region. That is, solve the system of equations consisting of the lines whose intersection is the vertex.  - Evaluate the objective function to be optimized at each vertex.  - Identify the maximum or minimum value of the objective function.  Ø Note that if two vertices of the feasible region are both solutions to a linear program, every point on the line segment connecting the two vertices will also be a solution. 4.2 Operations on functions","Linear,Programming,mathematical,model,consisting,linear,function,optimized,maximized,minimized,set,inequalities,representing,restrictions,resources,Objective,Function,function,maximized,minimized,linear,program,function,might,represent,amounts,money,earned,spent,goods,manufactured,delivered,variety,quantities,Constraints,linear,inequalities,Feasible,Region,solution,system,linear,inequalities,linear,program,solution,occur,vertex,corner,point,feasible,region,multiple,solutions,least,one,occur,vertex,solve,linear,program,Solve,system,linear,inequalities,Determine,coordinates,vertices,feasible,region,solve,system,equations,consisting,lines,whose,intersection,vertex,Evaluate,objective,function,optimized,vertex,Identify,maximum,minimum,value,objective,function,Note,two,vertices,feasible,region,solutions,linear,program,every,point,line,segment,connecting,two,vertices,also,solution,Operations,functions"
