4 IDX G9 HIST H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Crusades (1096–1291) temporarily established Christian rule in parts of the Middle East but had minimal long-term impact.,"Crusades,temporarily,established,Christian,rule,parts,Middle,East,minimal,long,term,impact"
