4 IDX G9 HIST H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Decline began with internal divisions and Christian Reconquista efforts, culminating in the fall of Granada in 1492.","Decline,began,internal,divisions,Christian,Reconquista,efforts,culminating,fall,Granada"
