7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Sediment transport: streamflow propelling sand, pebbles, gravel, and boulders downstream","Sediment,transport,streamflow,propelling,sand,pebbles,gravel,boulders,downstream"
7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Sediment load: material being carried by the stream,"Sediment,load,material,carried,stream"
