7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Suspended load: fine-grained clastic particles. held aloft in the stream until its velocity = 0, at 	which point they are deposited","Suspended,load,fine,grained,clastic,particles,held,aloft,stream,velocity,point,deposited"
7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Bed load: coarser materials that are moved by traction,"Bed,load,coarser,materials,moved,traction"
7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Traction: rolling/dragging of materials along the streambed,"Traction,rolling,dragging,materials,along,streambed"
7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Saltation: particles moving through short hops/jumps. particles moved through this manner are to large to remain in suspension but are not confined to traction,"Saltation,particles,moving,short,hops,jumps,particles,moved,manner,large,remain,suspension,confined,traction"
7 IDX G9 GEO H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,—more velocity = more suspended load,"velocity,suspended,load"
