8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,The Scientific Revolution,"Scientific,Revolution"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"In mid 1500s, the occurrence of science breaks the last bit of medieval thinking. The heart of Scientific Revolution is about making assumption of the dominance of mathematics in making laws for the world. The physical world can be managed and shaped by people.","mid,occurrence,science,breaks,last,bit,medieval,thinking,heart,Scientific,Revolution,making,assumption,dominance,mathematics,making,laws,world,physical,world,managed,shaped,people"
