8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,English: Francis Bacon. French: René Descartes.,"English,Francis,Bacon,French,Ren,Descartes"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"They rejected Aristotle’s assumption. Challenged medieval university, which they brought studies to fit in the church practices.","rejected,Aristotle,assumption,Challenged,medieval,university,brought,studies,fit,church,practices"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,They understood knowledge as something gained after a long process of investigation.,"understood,knowledge,something,gained,long,process,investigation"
