8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Exploring the Human Body,"Exploring,Human,Body"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Medieval physicians relied on the works of Galen for anatomy study. However, he made a lot of errors.","Medieval,physicians,relied,works,Galen,anatomy,study,However,made,lot,errors"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"In 1543, Andreas Vesalius published the first accurate and detailed study of human anatomy.","Andreas,Vesalius,published,first,accurate,detailed,study,human,anatomy"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"In the early 1540s, French physician Ambroise Peré developed a more efficient way of preventing infection.","early,French,physician,Ambroise,Per,developed,efficient,way,preventing,infection"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Peré also developed surgical techniques, introduced the concept of artificial limbs.","Per,also,developed,surgical,techniques,introduced,concept,artificial,limbs"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"In early 1600s, English scholar William Harvey introduced the blood cycle for the first time.","early,English,scholar,William,Harvey,introduced,blood,cycle,first,time"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"In late 1600s, Dutch inventor Anton van Leeuwenhoek invented microscope and saw cells and microorganisms.","late,Dutch,inventor,Anton,van,Leeuwenhoek,invented,microscope,saw,cells,microorganisms"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Transforming Chemistry,"Transforming,Chemistry"
