8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"1600s, English chemist Robert Boyle explained that all substances are composed of tiny particles instead of viewing chemicals as building blocks of substances.","English,chemist,Robert,Boyle,explained,substances,composed,tiny,particles,instead,viewing,chemicals,building,blocks,substances"
