8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Settlers spread through diverse regions—icy lands in the north, rainforests near the equator, and deserts in the south.","Settlers,spread,diverse,regions,icy,lands,north,rainforests,near,equator,deserts,south"
