8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Between 8500 B.C. and 2000 B.C., people began farming.","B,C,B,C,people,began,farming"
8 IDX HIST S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Crops in Mesoamerica included maize (corn), beans, squash, peppers, tomatoes, and sweet potatoes.","Crops,Mesoamerica,included,maize,corn,beans,squash,peppers,tomatoes,sweet,potatoes"
