1 G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"-Set: A collection of distinct objects, considered as an object in its own right.","Set,collection,distinct,objects,considered,object,right"
1 G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,-Element or Member: An object that makes up the set.,"Element,Member,object,makes,set"
1 G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,-Subset: A set A is a subset of set B if every element of A is also an element of B.,"Subset,set,subset,set,B,every,element,also,element,B"
