5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Reflectional Symmetry:,"Reflectional,Symmetry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,A figure has symmetry if there is an isometry that maps the figure onto itself.,"figure,symmetry,isometry,maps,figure,onto"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"If the isometry is the reflection of a plane figure, the figure has reflectional symmetry or line symmetry.","isometry,reflection,plane,figure,figure,reflectional,symmetry,line,symmetry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Rotational Symmetry:,"Rotational,Symmetry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,A figure that has rotational symmetry is its own image for some rotation of 180or less.,"figure,rotational,symmetry,image,rotation,less"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,A figure that has point symmetry has 180° rotational symmetry.,"figure,point,symmetry,rotational,symmetry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"A square has 90° and 180° rotational symmetry with the center of rotation at the center of the square. Thus, a square also has point symmetry.","square,rotational,symmetry,center,rotation,center,square,Thus,square,also,point,symmetry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,Dilation,Dilation
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"A dilation is a transformation whose preimage and image are similar. Thus, adilation is a similarity transformation. It is not, in general, an isometry.","dilation,transformation,whose,preimage,image,similar,Thus,adilation,similarity,transformation,general,isometry"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Every dilation has a center and a scale factor n,n >0. The scale factor describes the size change from the original figure to the image.","Every,dilation,center,scale,factor,n,n,scale,factor,describes,size,change,original,figure,image"
5 IDX G9 MATH H.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"To find a dilation with center C and scale factor n,you can use the following two rules.","find,dilation,center,C,scale,factor,n,use,following,two,rules"
