5 IDX G9 MATH S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,·Tangent ratio,"Tangent,ratio"
5 IDX G9 MATH S+.docx,2025-06-27 02:49:14,"Tangent ratio is defined as the ratio of the length of the opposite side to the length of the adjacent side relative to a given acute angle in a right triangle. For example, the tangent ratio of the angle A in the right picture is equals to ratio of a to b. BUT, it depends on the measure of the angle rather than the size of the sides.","Tangent,ratio,defined,ratio,length,opposite,side,length,adjacent,side,relative,given,acute,angle,right,triangle,example,tangent,ratio,angle,right,picture,equals,ratio,b,depends,measure,angle,rather,size,sides"
